1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:00,636
If a bullet

2
00:00:00,636 --> 00:00:01,373
hits your vest,

3
00:00:01,373 --> 00:00:02,451
you don't
fly backward,

4
00:00:02,451 --> 00:00:03,330
you barely budge.

5
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,528
Movies send heroes

6
00:00:04,528 --> 00:00:05,720
crashing through glass,

7
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,333
yet a bullet

8
00:00:06,333 --> 00:00:07,412
carries less momentum

9
00:00:07,412 --> 00:00:08,280
than a fastball.

10
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:09,747
Instead, woven golden

11
00:00:09,747 --> 00:00:11,133
Kevlar catches
the spinning

12
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:12,449
bullet like
a trampoline,

13
00:00:12,449 --> 00:00:13,835
spreading
that force across

14
00:00:13,835 --> 00:00:14,730
your whole chest.

15
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,462
For faster
rifle rounds,

16
00:00:16,462 --> 00:00:17,324
a ceramic plate

17
00:00:17,324 --> 00:00:18,324
shatters the metal

18
00:00:18,324 --> 00:00:18,949
tip to dust,

19
00:00:18,949 --> 00:00:19,699
while Dyneema

20
00:00:19,699 --> 00:00:20,730
traps every shard.

21
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:21,993
And Newton's Third

22
00:00:21,993 --> 00:00:22,611
Law seals it,

23
00:00:22,611 --> 00:00:23,342
any shot strong

24
00:00:23,342 --> 00:00:24,128
enough to launch

25
00:00:24,128 --> 00:00:24,915
you would launch

26
00:00:24,915 --> 00:00:25,730
the shooter too.

27
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:26,812
So real armor

28
00:00:26,812 --> 00:00:28,015
never sends
you flying,

29
00:00:28,015 --> 00:00:28,737
it just leaves

30
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:29,730
one brutal bruise.
